index 0000000..756342d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/releasenotes/notes/enabled-false-iterator-3f9c2a7d1e8b4c60.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    ``enabled=False`` is now honoured by the iterator pattern (``for attempt in
+    Retrying(...)`` and ``async for attempt in AsyncRetrying(...)``) and by calling
+    a ``Retrying`` object directly. The body runs exactly once and any exception
+    propagates unchanged, matching the ``@retry`` decorator path. Previously the
+    full retry loop ran and a ``RetryError`` was raised.
